          # EN | HOME, ENERGY and CORE are on-demand dashboards, not
          # EN | attached to any room, so they never go through the room
          # EN | create/modify/delete form above. One row per dashboard
          # EN | (vssp_dashboard_row, templates/decluttering_templates.yaml)
